  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Rural Roads Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to address the challenges associated with the (i) people&amp;apos;s lack of access to public services in rural areas, (ii) the loss of serviceability of roads damaged by the floods in 2022, and (ii) limited sustainability in road assets through rehabilitation of prioritized rural roads and execution and/or implementation of output and performance-based contracts.</narrative>
  </description>
